     1|/**
     2| * IVX Senior Developer Worker API
     3| *
     4| * Owner-only endpoints for submitting and polling autonomous senior developer
     5| * tasks. The actual work is performed by the IVX-SENIOR-DEV-01 background worker.
     6| *
     7| * POST /api/ivx/senior-developer/worker/jobs
     8| *   Creates a durable task (ivx_owner_ai_tasks) with task_type = 'senior_dev'.
     9| *   Returns HTTP 202 with taskId, status, assigned worker, and approval requirement.
    10| *
    11| * GET /api/ivx/senior-developer/worker/jobs/:taskId
    12| *   Returns the current task state and any evidence produced so far.
    13| *
    14| * POST /api/ivx/senior-developer/worker/jobs/:taskId/approve
    15| *   Owner approves a specific action (e.g., GitHub write, Render deploy) for a task.
    16| */
