   612|      // worker (backend/services/ivx-senior-dev-worker.ts), which runs the real
   613|      // 8-phase engineering pipeline (PLANNING→INSPECTING→IMPLEMENTING→TESTING→
   614|      // WAITING_APPROVAL→COMMITTING→DEPLOYING→LIVE_VERIFYING→VERIFIED).
   615|      // The general queue worker must NEVER claim senior_dev tasks — doing so
